    "body": "Hey there, this is the issue tracker for HTML, not XMLHttpRequest. That spec is over at https://github.com/whatwg/xhr/. However, I can already tell you what the answer will be: we're not adding new features to XMLHttpRequest, and instead you should use the Fetch API.\r\n\r\nI'll close this since it's off-topic for this repository, but feel free to open an issue on the XHR specification if you'd like the editor of that spec to help you understand why we're not adding new features to it, and why you should use fetch instead.",
